WEBVTT

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.750
This is the power of
the digital Sacred Beast!

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.250
Seiryu!

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:57.590
Kane, in his attempt
to control its power,

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:03.390
has been taken over by Cyber Dragoon,
which has taken control of the battle room.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.370
Finish him off!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.370
Why you...

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.920
You don't have to fight anymore.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:40.050
After seeing how injured Seiryu was,
Takao attempted to forfeit the match, but...

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:43.640
Seiryu somehow ignored Takao's command!

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.450
Go, Seiryu!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.140
Salima!

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.260
Go, Cyber Dragoon!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.230
How can you do
that to your friend?

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:41.610
I won't forgive anyone
who hurts their friends!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:47.870
In the middle of that, Salima was hurt by Kane,
who tried to stop their battle.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:52.870
By hurting his friend,
Kane has enraged Takao to the highest degree!

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.770
Go, Dragoon!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.150
Cyber Dragoon!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.320
All right!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.030
Seiryu!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.800
You better not lose!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.890
Fight back, Cyber Dragoon!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.970
This isn't the extent of our power!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.100
Kane...

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.120
The only friend I need
is Cyber Dragoon!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.120
What?!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:20.170
The power of the digital
Sacred Beast is all I can rely on!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.140
What the hell?!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.070
Kane!!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.570
Finish him off, Cyber Dragoon!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.540
Crush him!!!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:12.930
Kane!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.100
What's going on?

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:22.690
The digital Sacred Beast's intense growth
is causing damage to Kane's body!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:23.690
What?

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:28.740
His body can't control
that monster anymore.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.200
K-Kane!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.240
Stay back!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.040
I won't let you interrupt my battle.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:53.970
I will control... the Sacred
Beast and the Bey...!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:02.480
Any normal Blader would
have passed out by now.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:07.650
So Kane's body can't keep
up with his willpower?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.740
Go!!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.250
If this battle doesn't end soon,
Kane's body will be in danger!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.210
We have to stop Kane! Now!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.880
Can anyone even stop him?

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.130
Then what are
we supposed to do?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:32.260
Kinomiya has to defeat Cyber
Dragoon as soon as he can.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.850
There's no other
way to save Kane.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.100
Takao!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.350
Takao!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:42.770
Go, Dragoon!

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.270
Oh, crap!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.990
Unleash your fury, Cyber Dragoon!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.420
Stop!!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.890
I will control both the Sacred Beast...

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.300
and the...

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.080
Kane!!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.540
No!!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:52.170
Please... Save Kane!!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.720
Dragoon!!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.870
Takao's about to reach his limit.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.750
I'm not giving up on you, Kane!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.210
Kane...!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.220
I'll show you the
power of Seiryu and me!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.050
Let's do this, Seiryu!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.520
Go, Dragoon!!

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.790
H-he won!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:48.040
You did it!

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.790
Incredible, Takao!!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.840
I knew you could win!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.960
That's our Takao for you!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.140
Kane...

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.180
My Cyber Dragoon...

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.280
Amazing, Takao!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.860
It's a miracle!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.240
I guess it is!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:38.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.140
What's happening?

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.480
Could it be from the explosion the
digital Sacred Beast caused?

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.150
What do you mean it "caused" it?

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.190
This tower might be falling apart.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.230
What?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.900
We gotta get outside!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.250
Stay with me, Salima!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.910
Are you okay, Kane?

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:12.960
Kinomiya...

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.690
Jim! Jim!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.440
Wake up!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:51.040
Doctor! This is what I
get for relying on you!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.500
What are you doing?!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.790
That's the self-destruct button!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.760
It's over! It's all over!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.840
What the hell is
wrong with you?!

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.030
Are you okay, Takao?

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.070
Kane!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.240
Jim! Goki!
I'm glad you're okay.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.790
Take care of her!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.750
Max, wait!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.500
I'm not leaving Genbu!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.880
--Max!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.170
Max!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.760
--Takao!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.090
Children! You're safe!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.600
Chairman!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.560
It's dangerous here.
We need to evacuate!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.560
Darn it!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.820
Genbu!!

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.360
Max!!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.950
Wait for me, Genbu.
I'm coming for you!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.160
Genbu!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.500
Let's do this!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.290
--Shoot!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.430
Genbu!!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:34.970
Genbu!

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.940
Genbu...!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:59.120
I refuse to be abandoned here...!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:04.040
I have to report this
to Doctor Zagart!

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.810
Hurry! It's gonna fall!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.980
Guys! You alright?!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.460
Is everyone alright?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.710
Yeah, surprisingly.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.590
It's dangerous to stay
this close to the tower!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.470
Takao...!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.890
Takao!!!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.380
Kinomiya!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.630
Max!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:14.880
Takao! Max!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.470
Yes!!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.850
I'm so glad!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:23.980
Ozma!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.360
I thought I was a goner!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.940
What's important is
that you're safe.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:34.900
You worried us until
the very last minute!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.860
Have a little faith in us!

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.030
Right you are!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.160
So, what about Genbu?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.910
Did you get him back?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:43.750
Yup.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.250
Yay!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.340
I'm glad for you, Max!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.250
Yeah.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.380
Ozma's team saved Genbu.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.770
Ozma! Thanks for saving Genbu!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:09.060
We didn't save Genbu for you.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.400
Ozma!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:15.900
Don't forget!
We aren't on your side!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.740
And that's that.

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:22.330
We will take your Sacred Beasts!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:28.170
So hold on to 'em
nice and tight for now.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:42.510
What's their deal?

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.510
Kinomiya.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.430
Kane!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.730
Why did you save us?

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:53.650
Because I want to fight you again.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.480
What?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:59.450
I didn't beat the
real Kane Yamashita.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:03.280
So I want to fight you
on equal ground

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:07.250
and settle the score with you!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.330
I'm gonna be the winner, though!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:13.880
I'll accept your challenge
when that day comes.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:18.800
I think I was wrong about
the Sacred Beasts.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:23.260
Sacred Beasts don't
have to be bad.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:28.890
When I think about our battles, we learned
about the deep bonds that the BBA team shares,

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:35.570
and the strength of the connection shared
between a Blader and their Sacred Beast.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.650
Never give up, no matter what.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:45.080
Takao, thanks to you and Seiryu,
we've learned that lesson.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.450
Thanks to me?

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.040
Look at you!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.080
Oh, shut up.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.460
You don't have to pretend to be mad.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.130
I ain't mad!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:01.300
In the end, the source of the
problem was manipulating

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:07.350
the hearts of people with the manufactured
power of the digital Sacred Beasts.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:20.440
Oh, what a gorgeous sunrise!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:25.200
What's next for you?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.660
I think we're going back to our travels.
Starting from scratch.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:36.380
We want to travel across the
world and reaffirm who we are.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.050
Take care, you guys.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.440
Don't forget...

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.940
Your promise to us!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.320
Yeah!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.070
Take care, Kinomiya.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.950
You too, Kane.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:05.030
After defeating Psykick for good, Takao and the team go to New York by invitation from Max's mom, Judy.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:09.070
Some incredible things happen that involve an ancient stone tablet.

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:12.410
By the way, what were you up to all this time, Chairman?

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:16.330
What? "You got your own toilet to use as your chair, man?"

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:20.290
Hey! You're not coming to New York with us!
